---
// Features.astro
---

<section id="features" class="py-24 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 border border-emerald-500/20">
        <i class="ri-flashlight-line"></i>
        <span>核心工程创新</span>
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
        专为 AI Coding Agent 打造的六大硬核特性
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        从证据解析、新鲜度追踪到自动化自愈，Loredex 在底层工程架构上彻底重塑了代码库知识的生命周期。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Features Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
      
      <!-- Feature 1: Evidence Pinned -->
      <div class="card-glow p-6 sm:p-7 flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400 mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:border-emerald-400/50 transition-all duration-300">
            <i class="ri-pushpin-line text-2xl"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">
            Evidence 证据强钉定
          </h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            每个事实声明都携带内联引用 <code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 text-emerald-300 font-mono text-xs">[[cite:path:Lx-Ly]]</code>。落库时解析为 <span class="text-white font-mono text-xs">(路径, 行区间, blob sha, 内容 sha1)</span> 四元组。没有引用的内容直接拒绝入库。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">
          <span>防凭空捏造</span>
          <span class="text-emerald-400">Zero-Hallucination</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2: Git Native Freshness -->
      <div class="card-glow p-6 sm:p-7 flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-teal-500/10 border border-teal-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-teal-400 mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:border-teal-400/50 transition-all duration-300">
            <i class="ri-git-commit-line text-2xl"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors">
            Git 驱动的双重过期判定
          </h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            不迷信 commit 标号。对比 HEAD blob 并通过 tree diff 交叉验证，校验时直接重算代码行区间 SHA1 哈希。代码只要一发生变更，相关引用页面即刻标记为 stale。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">
          <span>双重校验</span>
          <span class="text-teal-400">Blob + Tree Diff</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 3: Drift Auto-Healing -->
      <div class="card-glow p-6 sm:p-7 flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-400 mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:border-cyan-400/50 transition-all duration-300">
            <i class="ri-route-line text-2xl"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">
            行号漂移投影自愈
          </h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            源码增删非相关行，旧引用无需手动改。基于 <span class="text-white font-mono text-xs">similar</span> 行级 diff 自动映射新位置，相似度 ≥ 0.6 自动采纳并留痕，页面无损恢复 verified。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">
          <span>算法自愈</span>
          <span class="text-cyan-400">Similarity &ge; 0.6</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 4: Content Addressing Rename -->
      <div class="card-glow p-6 sm:p-7 flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-400 mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:border-indigo-400/50 transition-all duration-300">
            <i class="ri-cursor-line text-2xl"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">
            重命名内容寻址反查
          </h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            当项目发生 <code class="px-1 rounded bg-slate-800 text-indigo-300 font-mono text-xs">git mv</code> 重构时，按 blob oid 在 HEAD 直接反查新路径。比常规启发式重命名更精准，重命名文件引用不迷路。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">
          <span>内容寻址</span>
          <span class="text-indigo-400">Blob OID Reverse</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 5: Secret Guard -->
      <div class="card-glow p-6 sm:p-7 flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-rose-500/10 border border-rose-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-rose-400 mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:border-rose-400/50 transition-all duration-300">
            <i class="ri-shield-keyhole-line text-2xl"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-rose-400 transition-colors">
            密钥门禁与预览脱敏
          </h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            引用行区间命中 API Key、Token 或私钥块形态时，写入立即拦截并拒绝。<code class="px-1 rounded bg-slate-800 text-rose-300 font-mono text-xs">lint</code> 持续回扫存量页面，敏感明文绝不落盘、绝不回显。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">
          <span>安全守卫</span>
          <span class="text-rose-400">Zero Secret Leaks</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 6: Zero DB & Pure Markdown -->
      <div class="card-glow p-6 sm:p-7 flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400 mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:border-amber-400/50 transition-all duration-300">
            <i class="ri-markdown-line text-2xl"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors">
            零数据库与纯文本哲学
          </h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Frontmatter 就是权威数据库。所有知识以纯 Markdown 随 Git 仓库提交与 PR 审核。内存分词倒排索引毫秒级构建，无损坏、无锁死、免复杂运维。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">
          <span>Git 原生</span>
          <span class="text-amber-400">Pure Markdown</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
